.\" sample.mdoc: a man page using the mdoc macros
.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt SAMPLE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm sample
.Nd show a page of text
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl v
.Op Fl w Ar width
.Op Ar
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility prints each
.Ar file .
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl v
Print more.
.It Fl w Ar width
Wrap at
.Ar width
columns
.Pq default 80 .
.El
.Bl -bullet
.It
A bullet.
.It
Another bullet.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
sample -w 40 notes.txt
.Ed
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr cat 1 ,
.Lk https://example.org/sample "the sample site"
